# The Dire Minotaur: an escaped bull-headed prisoner of the maze, huge and furious, with thick curved horns, a gold nose ring, an iron belt and broken shackles on its wrists. Fixed colours, so one base variant.
size 40 32
anim idle 0 1 4 loop
anim telegraph 2 3 8 loop
anim attack 4 5 10 once
anim vulnerable 6 7 6 loop
